{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"positions"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The positions of records in this store a delivery handed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations."}]}],"name":"positions"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The records kept at those positions, each tagged with its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"naming this store, in any order."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A delivery calls it once that destination has caught up, hands it the records returned,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and counts its receipt towards "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for those records alone. A position the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store no longer keeps (its bound dropped the record, which it reports) gives no record, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does any position when the store can’t read records back, as with the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementation. The delivery never acknowledges a record it couldn’t hand to every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, so a store that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delivery gives each record returned the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitive-value visibility and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the record had when the buffer dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"records(at:)","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeliveryTag.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DeliveryTag.swift#L77"},"externalID":"s:6Events12AcknowledgerP7records2atSayAA11EventRecordVGSays6UInt64VG_tF","required":true,"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The records this store still keeps at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"text":", read back for a destination whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivery buffer dropped them before it received them.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"anchor":"Acknowledger-Implementations","title":"Acknowledger Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u"]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/records(at:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","defaultImplementations":1,"title":"records(at:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The records this store still keeps at ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", read back for a destination whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivery buffer dropped them before it received them.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DeliveryTag":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/deliverytag","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeliveryTag","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeliveryTag","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"DeliveryTag","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Where a store keeps a record until it is delivered: the store, and the record’s position in it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What keeps records until their delivery is acknowledged: a store, as a delivery sees it."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"title":"Acknowledger","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/records(at:)-4jg2u":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"No records: a store that can’t read its records back keeps those of a batch a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination’s full buffer dropped for a later launch to deliver."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"records(at:)","url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"title":"Events","url":"\/documentation\/events","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","abstract":[]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"title":"EventRecord","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/isRedelivered":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/isredelivered","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the record may have reached a destination before: it was handed to a delivery in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"earlier run of the app, which ended before the delivery was acknowledged."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isRedelivered","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"isRedelivered","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/acknowledge(_:)":{"title":"acknowledge(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"acknowledge"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","required":true,"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every destination has received the records at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":", so the store can forget them."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)"}}}